+0.24.2 (not yet released)
+-------------------------
+
+- Raise the floor on the ``typing_extensions`` dependency from ``>=4.0`` to ``>=4.4``.
+  On Python < 3.12, :mod:`bidict` imports ``override`` from ``typing_extensions``,
+  which did not provide it until 4.4.0.
+  The old floor therefore admitted resolutions
+  in which ``import bidict`` failed with
+  ``ImportError: cannot import name 'override' from 'typing_extensions'``.
+
+
